# Wave W17-AB (Route 224): head pine — a coast pine in deep blue-greens, tiered and wind-kept, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on head turf (ground baked in). Route 224’s own tree — split from Foamline’s shore pine by stance entire (a walked dry coast vs the causeway’s shore ends) and from Route 221’s tide pine by colour: this crown is deep coast green in League light, that one marsh blue-green.
